我完全没想到，我的新书签会成为我最喜欢物品的有力竞争者。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A bookmark with a photo of author John Green in a mustache (Pizza John, from an annual fundraiser called Pizzamas) shows above a photo of James Agee on the cover of Letters of James Agee to Father Flye" height="4080" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/duggan/6ad81892c7713.jpg" width="3072"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://duggan.some.pics"&gt;@duggan&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:42:47 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>错误不定义你的巫术</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad7f684ee05a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一个错误并不能定义你的巫术。如果你在念咒语时忘了念到哪儿，或者把正在编织的绳子缠乱了，你可以停下来再试一次。你是在做一件需要练习的事，而不是在参加考试。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted charcoal-black and muted rose-pink fantasy scene of a gray-haired witch untangling braided cord at a wooden worktable, with loose cord beside a basket. A round window overlooks green fields and floating islands with a windmill. Warm ivory serif lettering fills the upper wall, and a gold botanical emblem watermark appears at bottom-right. Text: A mistake doesn't define your witchcraft. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6ad7f684ee05a.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 23:17:27 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>